 "intro_zh": "鼋头渚，独占太湖风景最美一角，山清水秀，天然胜景。鼋头渚风景区现有充山隐秀、鹿顶迎晖、鼋渚春涛、横云山庄等10多处景点。其中有山长水阔、帆影点点的自然山水画卷；有小桥流水，绿树人家的山乡田园风光；有典雅精致、古朴纯净的江南园林景致。",
 "intro_en": "Yuantouzhu occupies the most beautiful corner of Taihu Lake, with beautiful mountains and clear waters and natural scenery. Yuantouzhu Scenic Area currently has more than 10 scenic spots, including Chongshan Yinxiu, Luding Yinghui, Yuanzhu Chuntao, and Hengyun Villa. Among them are natural landscape paintings with long mountains and wide rivers and dotted sail shadows; rural pastoral scenery with small bridges and flowing water, green trees and people; and elegant, delicate, simple and pure Jiangnan garden scenery.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
